{"id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-numeral.md","title":"Numeral","display":"df-numeral — Numeral","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-numeral","aliases":["88-df-numeral"],"display":"df-numeral — Numeral","depends_on":["[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-closed-term]]","[[88-df-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-numeral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-numeral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-numeral — Numeral"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c5b1e64ccdf8eae8\" href=\"?note=c5b1e64ccdf8eae8\" title=\"88-df-closed-term\">88-df-closed-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-numeral-—-Numeral-$\\bar{n}$\">df-numeral — Numeral <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n}\">\\(\\bar{n}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf s\">\\(\\mathsf s\\)</span> (constant and unary successor symbols)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\nu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (numeral constructor)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (notation for the term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(n)\">\\(\\nu(n)\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (closed-term predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为候选签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 含有同一常量符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 和一元函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf s\">\\(\\mathsf s\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_S\">\\(\\nu_S\\)</span> 是下述有限迭代图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>当公式属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_S(n)\">\\(\\nu_S(n)\\)</span>；须先有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\)</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_S=\\nu\">\\(\\nu_S=\\nu\\)</span>，保留原有算术数词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a> 的一元一阶签名谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land0\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\land\\mathsf s\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land0\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\land\\mathsf s\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\nu_S\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,t\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S:\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\land\n\\exists d:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(d(0)=0\\land d(n)=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i&lt;n\\to d(i+1)=\\mathsf s(d(i))))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\nu_S\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,t\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S:\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\land\n\\exists d:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(d(0)=0\\land d(n)=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i&lt;n\\to d(i+1)=\\mathsf s(d(i))))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\to\n\\Bigl(\\nu_S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_S\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(\\nu_S(n))\\Bigr),\n\\qquad\\nu\\coloneqq\\nu_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\to\n\\Bigl(\\nu_S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_S\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(\\nu_S(n))\\Bigr),\n\\qquad\\nu\\coloneqq\\nu_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\nu(0)\\coloneqq0,\n\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\nu(n+1)\\coloneqq\\mathsf s(\\nu(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\nu(0)\\coloneqq0,\n\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\nu(n+1)\\coloneqq\\mathsf s(\\nu(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\bar n\\coloneqq\\nu(n)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\bar n\\coloneqq\\nu(n)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\bar n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\bar n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\to\\nu_S=\\nu\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\to\\nu_S=\\nu\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> : 由对象语言符号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\mathsf s\">\\(0,\\mathsf s\\)</span>构成的闭项</li>\n<li>元层递归索引使用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>，但构造出的项使用句法符号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf s\">\\(\\mathsf s\\)</span>；因此\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span>不是元层自然数，也不是数值函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(S_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>的值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-numeral-—-Numeral-$\\bar{n}$","text":"df-numeral — Numeral $\\bar{n}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-closed-term","status":"resolved","id":"c5b1e64ccdf8eae8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-closed-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Language}(S)$ 使用 [[88-df-language]] 的一元一阶签名谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\bar{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"