ith}}}(\\bar n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\to\\nu_S=\\nu","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\mathsf s","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf s","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathbb N}","display":false}],"bytes":2459,"backlinks":[{"id":"ceae3257aec622e2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d161ce567387339","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c5b1e64ccdf8eae8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]：数字 $\\overline{n}$ 是特殊闭项"},{"id":"268c5641ccf6ec59","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为一阶签名；$\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)$、$\\nu_S$ 见 [[88-df-numeral]]。本文件的 $\\bar n$ 在公式所属签名中解释为 $\\nu_S(n)$；$v_i=v_i^S$，$i\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"75bb18f474452a05","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)$ 使用 [[88-df-numeral]] 的 $\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)$ 与 $\\nu_S$；第一式 $\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T)$ 仍适用于任意一阶签名。"},{"id":"254200a991dbb642","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"14e11c6d19d5648b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":5,"excerpt":"$\\bar n$ (numeral, see [[88-df-numeral]])"},{"id":"6bf67ec77619bc8d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"96e88157ef117acf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2aa923dca170bacd","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\overline n$ (numeral for $n$, see [[88-df-numeral]])"},{"id":"f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\